  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-10-22T14:56:16.637Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Often, a little thumbnail picture of a world, or it's name or description is just not enough for me to be able to tell if I want to check it out or not.\n\nFor game worlds, I cannot tell if it's interesting and worth the time.\n\nThis and many other problems could be solved by introducing a video preview option to a world.\n\nThis would appear on the world detail page in game and on the website (mockup pictures in attachment).\n\nVideo should be a link from whitelisted sources, youtube, vimeo and others. On the website an embedd video, ingame it should be an ingame, inmenu player.\n\nThis will give world creators more ways to get people interested in checking out their world.",
